      <h1>Last 60 minutes before 14:00: sit O’Reilly’s and Dubliners, then walk the two 14:00 doors</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        It is about <strong>13:00</strong>. Four Corner on Calle de la Victoria 6 is still shut — <strong>one hour</strong>, not three, not overnight.
        Sit <strong>now</strong> at O’Reilly’s, Pasaje de Matheu 4 (usual from 11:30) and Dubliners, Espoz y Mina 7 (usual Sunday from 12:00).
        At 14:00 walk Four Corner (sports screens, not open before) <strong>and</strong> O’Connell’s usual Sunday door at the same number as Dubliners.
        Not a restaurant table for three spare hours. Not lunch then Bengals. Maps below.
      </p>
