      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <dl class="faq">
        <dt><strong>~13:00, one hour until Four Corner. Where do I sit?</strong></dt>
        <dd>O’Reilly’s, Pasaje de Matheu 4 (usual 11:30) or Dubliners, Espoz y Mina 7 (usual Sunday 12:00). Last 60 minutes, not a three-hour table. Do not wait on Victoria 6 before 14:00.</dd>
        <dt><strong>At 14:00, which two doors?</strong></dt>
        <dd>Four Corner Victoria 6 (sports screens, not before 14:00) and O’Connell’s usual Sunday door at Espoz y Mina 7. From Matheu: 2 min and 1 min. From Dubliners: next door and 1–2 min to Victoria 6.</dd>
        <dt><strong>Does this last hour replace Premier, NFL or Atleti 21:00?</strong></dt>
        <dd>No. Coordinate. 15:00 Premier block (~2 h from 13:00), United 17:30, NFL 15:30 / from 19:00, Atleti 21:00 sit alongside after you walk. Named listings: Dubliners What’s On only.</dd>
      </dl>

